Base Harness External

This repository is extracted from the external-Harness implementation in
https://github.com/doo513/base_harness and its subsequent local working changes.
The source checkout baseline was 4886682b0e11cdd54ceee349657929f61428a6e6;
the external CLI was developed after that commit and is not claimed to exist
in that commit unchanged.

Reused components include the Python v5 measurement engine, canonical
serialization/atomic-record/redaction helpers, the Develop domain manifest,
and the strict Sandbox implementation. Original applicable copyright and
license notices are preserved in LICENSE and individual files.

The shared helpers were extracted into harness.common; the legacy verifier
engine and Ready issuer are not included. The former agent Host, UI, provider
gateway, account data and session databases are also not included.

The reference Develop manifest describes its original runtime domain. This
external adapter reuses its criteria metadata; it does not grant the original
runtime's mutation or delegation permissions.
